{"slug": "zaandam", "synopsis": "Made in 1921, this silent film records Zaandam as a town shaped by rivers and canals. Views across the Zaan show a small shipyard, moored vessels, working boats, and the lock complex, where a steam yacht enters the lock.\\\\n\\\\nBeyond the waterfront, pedestrians move along a canal-side industrial street and a broad, tree-lined road. A monument, churches, substantial town buildings, a quiet narrow waterway, and a raised drawbridge complete the portrait of the town.", "clips": [{"id": "c534d006-eb20-5a05-bf06-592a0478d01d", "sourceSlug": "zaandam", "sourceTitle": "Zaandam", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 2.84, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/clips/0000000000-0000002840.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/thumbnails/0000000000-0000002840.jpg"}, {"id": "18ee58a9-4f80-5cc3-82c0-3237334e61b9", "sourceSlug": "zaandam", "sourceTitle": "Zaandam", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 2.84, "endSeconds": 11.68, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/clips/0000002840-0000011680.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/thumbnails/0000002840-0000011680.jpg"}, {"id": "b2756917-9bec-5bbd-9d9a-88fa2ed1cbf6", "sourceSlug": "zaandam", "sourceTitle": "Zaandam", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 11.68, "endSeconds": 24.04, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/clips/0000011680-0000024040.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/zaandam/thumbnails/0000011680-0000024040.jpg"}, {"id": "2cb856b8-1120-51fd-9673-e76bc89c9256", "sourceSlug": "zaandam", "sourceTitle": "Zaandam", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 3, "startSeconds": 24.04, "endSeconds": 46.92, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2